# The reward and penalty simulations build states with up to 2625 ML-DSA-87
# validators over several epochs; one binary running them next to other tests
# exhausts a 16 GB CI runner. CI runs this target in a job of its own; the
# cpu:4 tag keeps Bazel from scheduling other tests beside it elsewhere.
